<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank calls for bids on 2-wk repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank calls for bids on 2-wk repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Wednesday called for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of 3.0 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 0800 GMT on Friday, it said.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank allocated 15.45 billion schillings in two-week repos, filling 12 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
